{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802020/extras/DiceyWords_Title_01.gif?t=1749916665\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get a taste of <i>Dicey Words</i>\u2014the dice-based word-building roguelike where every roll and every word counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo, you\u2019ll play through <strong>25 rounds</strong> of strategic spelling and dice manipulation. Roll letter dice, lock and reroll to build five-letter words and rack up points. Experiment with a <strong>selection of sample badges</strong> that twist the rules and unlock new strategies with each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802020/extras/Show_Badge_01.gif?t=1749916665\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ll play on the default difficulty setting and experience how small choices can lead to big rewards. Whether you\u2019re crafting the perfect word or chasing high-score combos, every round offers a fresh puzzle to solve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>What\u2019s in the demo:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">25 rounds of word-building gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Default difficulty mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A curated set of sample badges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A first look at the roguelike mechanics and strategic depth</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try your luck, sharpen your vocabulary, and preview the full <i>Dicey Words</i> experience\u2014one roll, one word at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802020/extras/DiceyWords_Title.gif?t=1749916665\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3802020?t=1749916665","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3802020?t=1749916665","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802020/f55636de46e1c93ccca8f4455638895abaeaa9bc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749916665","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802020/f55636de46e1c93ccca8f4455638895abaeaa9bc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749916665","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802020/extras/DiceyWords_Title_01.gif?t=1749916665\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get a taste of <i>Dicey Words</i>\u2014the dice-based word-building roguelike where every roll and every word counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo, you\u2019ll play through <strong>25 rounds</strong> of strategic spelling and dice manipulation. Roll letter dice, lock and reroll to build five-letter words and rack up points. Experiment with a <strong>selection of sample badges</strong> that twist the rules and unlock new strategies with each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802020/extras/Show_Badge_01.gif?t=1749916665\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"